#: resources/views/modules/statistics-chart/tabs/tree-health.phtml:150
msgid ""
"A date row counts the individuals whose event is missing or has no usable "
"date. A place row counts the individuals whose event is missing or has no "
"place. The birth rows count every individual, the death rows count only "
"deceased individuals, and the marriage rows count the individuals who are a "
"spouse in a family. A person counts as living when no death, burial or "
"cremation is recorded and the birth is not older than the maximum age that "
"the tree allows."
msgstr ""

#: resources/views/modules/statistics-chart/tabs/life-span.phtml:647
#: resources/views/modules/statistics-chart/tabs/life-span.phtml:667
msgid "A fuller cell marks a busier month"
msgstr "Une cellule plus remplie indique un mois plus chargé"

#: src/Statistic.php:248
msgid ""
"A person counts as living when no death, burial or cremation is recorded and "
"the birth is not older than the maximum age that the tree allows."
msgstr ""
"Une personne est considérée comme vivante lorsqu'aucun décès, aucune "
"inhumation ni aucune crémation n'est enregistré et que sa naissance ne "
"remonte pas plus loin que l'âge maximal admis par l'arbre."

#: resources/views/modules/statistics-chart/tabs/places.phtml:96
msgid ""
"A sedentary or sparsely-documented population: most individuals carry only "
"one recorded place, which is as often a gap in place documentation as a "
"truly settled life."
msgstr ""
"Une population sédentaire ou peu documentée : la plupart des individus ne "
"sont associés qu'à un seul lieu répertorié, ce qui traduit aussi souvent une "
"lacune dans les données géographiques qu'une vie véritablement sédentaire."

