#: resources/views/modules/statistics-chart/tabs/family.phtml:160
msgid ""
"Age at marriage, counted per marriage, so a person who married more than "
"once appears once for each marriage. The mirror axis separates husbands and "
"wives, as shown by the labels at each side. Both sides share the same age "
"bands, so the two distributions can be compared at a glance."
msgstr ""

